{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>皇崗口岸下午2時起過關返港人流明顯增加，自助閘門及人工櫃枱幾乎全部開放，過關不需要排隊很久。本台記者早前經皇崗口岸返港，半分鐘就可以過關，過程暢順。</p><p></p><p>入境處提醒下午至晚上是入境高峰。</p><p></p><p>➤　<a href=\"https://news.tvb.com/tc/1199889-%E6%96%B0%E7%9A%87%E5%B4%97%E5%8F%A3%E5%B2%B8%E4%BA%A4%E9%80%9A%E6%94%BB%E7%95%A5%E7%9B%B4%E9%81%94%E6%B8%AF%E4%B9%9D%E6%96%B0%E7%95%8C%E5%90%84%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A%E8%BB%8A%E8%B2%BB%E6%9C%8D%E5%8B%99%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E9%80%9A%E5%AE%B5%E8%BB%8A%E4%B8%80%E6%96%87%E7%9C%8B%E6%B8%85\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>新皇崗口岸‧交通攻略｜直達港九新界各路線車費、服務時間、通宵車｜一文看清</strong></a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-19T09:39:28.084964+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":130,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-19T08:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T10:57:05.015890+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-19T09:37:49.111136+00:00","content_hash":"e3e03b052284b9be1f7797ee685c95377d46a8bcc614fb167c8eebc26e04f764","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}